  "prefLabel": "Env-A 613.04 False Statements",
  "priorExpiration": "2011-10-24",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 613.04 False Statements. The department shall revoke any permit if, following opportunity for a hearing in accordance with RSA 541-A:30, II, a finding is made that the permit was issued in whole or in part based upon any information proven to be materially false or misleading.\n\nSource. #6057-B, eff 6-30-95 (from Env-A 607.04); ss by #7879, eff 4-26-03 (formerly Env-A 615.04); ss by #9906, INTERIM, eff 4-26-11, EXPIRES: 10-24-11; ss by #10000, eff 10-1-11; ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
